### updating a cake
PATCH  http://127.0.0.1:8000/cake/1/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=abc

--abc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Chocolate vancho Cake
--abc--

### deleting cake

DELETE   http://127.0.0.1:8000/cake/1/

